&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:1pt;font-size:1pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;(注) １. 新株予約権の行使による増加であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;２. &lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;2022年６月13日を払込期日とする&lt;/span&gt;第三者割当増資&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;により、発行済株式総数が539,300株、資本金及び資本準備金がそれぞれ249,965千円増加しております。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ChangesInNumberOfIssuedSharesStatedCapitalEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ShareholdingByShareholderCategoryTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
